<div class="reflist" style="list-style-type: decimal;">
<ol class="references">
<li id="cite&#95;note-1"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><a href="#cite_ref-1">↑</a></span> <span class="reference-text">Gustavsen, Alv Hågård.&#32;<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://www.nasjonalmuseet.no/en/stories/explore-the-collection/munch-malet-av-gal-mann-engelsk/">Could only have been painted by a madman</a>.&#32;<i>National Museum of Norway</i>. Retrieved on <span class="mw-formatted-date" title="2021-02-22">22 February 2021</span>.</span>
</li>
<li id="cite&#95;note-2"><span class="mw-cite-backlink"><a href="#cite_ref-2">↑</a></span> <span class="reference-text">Picheta, Rob&#32;(<span class="mw-formatted-date" title="2021-02-22">22 February 2021</span>).&#32;<a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="https://edition.cnn.com/style/article/edvard-munch-the-scream-inscription-scli-intl/index.html">'Painted by a madman': Edvard Munch wrote a hidden message on 'The Scream'</a>.&#32;<i><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CNN" class="extiw" title="w:CNN">cnn.com</a></i>. Retrieved on <span class="mw-formatted-date" title="2021-02-22">22 February 2021</span>.</span>
</li>
</ol></div></td>
